// M10B export preset — archival_lossless.
// Spec §"Player-facing behavior" bullet "Export is deterministic
// within scope": FFV1 intra-frame mathematically lossless codec in an
// mkv container (mp4 cannot natively carry FFV1). Audio is FLAC
// (mathematically lossless). target_bitrate_kbps is `1` as a
// placeholder; FFV1 is quality-driven (intra-frame quantizer =
// lossless) and the encoder ignores this field for FFV1 entirely —
// the resulting bitrate is derived from visual content. The schema
// declares `"minimum": 1` so the placeholder satisfies it; the
// encoder switches behaviour by `ExportPreset::codec` (PresetCodec::Ffv1)
// rather than reading this field. The deterministic encoder profile
// uses single-thread + 1-frame GOP (every frame is a keyframe —
// intra-frame coding) per
// cf_replay_export::ffmpeg_bridge::DeterministicEncoderProfile::archival_lossless().
// VAL-M10B-020 contract: byte-identical sha256 across two same-host
// runs AND across Linux x86_64 / macOS aarch64 / Windows x86_64.
(
    name: "archival_lossless",
    resolution: (
        width: 1920,
        height: 1080,
    ),
    fps: 60,
    codec: ffv1,
    audio_codec: "flac",
    target_bitrate_kbps: 1,
    container: mkv,
)
